sequenceDiagram
  participant GH as GitHub Actions job
  participant OP as GitHub OIDC provider
  participant STS as AWS STS
  participant AWS as AWS services
  GH->>OP: Request ID token (id-token write)
  OP-->>GH: Signed JWT (sub, aud, repo, ref)
  GH->>STS: AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity (JWT, role ARN)
  Note over STS: Verify signature, aud, sub against trust policy
  STS-->>GH: Temporary credentials (1 hour)
  GH->>AWS: Deploy with temporary credentials
